====Usage notes====
In writing, {{m|bg||във}} is used in front of words starting with ⟨в⟩ or ⟨ф⟩ and {{m|bg|в}} is used elsewhere. In speech, {{m|bg|в}} and {{m|bg||във}} are used interchangeably. In writing and in speech, '''във''' is also used as a stressed form of {{m|bg|в}}, even before words not beginning with ⟨в⟩ or ⟨ф⟩, as in
: {{ux|bg|Тя е '''във''' къщата, а не отвън.|She is '''in''' the house, not outside.}}
In verse, {{m|bg||във}} can also be used in front of words not starting with ⟨в⟩ or ⟨ф⟩ in order to maintain the syllable structure of the line.